```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Order Confirmation | Elearning</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7fb;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 15px;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        /* Header */

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
            padding: 32px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #c4b5fd;
        }

        .success-icon {
            width: 58px;
            height: 58px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #e0e7ff;
        }

        /* Content */

        .content {
            padding: 35px 30px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin: 0 0 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #111827;
        }

        /* Order meta */

        .order-meta {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .order-meta td {
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        .order-meta td:last-child {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .order-meta strong {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 5px;
            color: #111827;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* Course */

        .course-card {
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .course-card-header {
            padding: 18px 20px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }

        .course-label {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background-color: #ede9fe;
            color: #6d28d9;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .course-name {
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .course-details {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .course-details td {
            padding: 16px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4b5563;
        }

        .course-details td:nth-child(2) {
            text-align: center;
            width: 80px;
        }

        .course-details td:last-child {
            text-align: right;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #111827;
            width: 120px;
        }

        /* Price summary */

        .summary {
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        .summary-row {
            width: 100%;
            display: table;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        .summary-label,
        .summary-value {
            display: table-cell;
        }

        .summary-value {
            text-align: right;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .total-row {
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding-top: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .total-row .summary-value {
            color: #4f46e5;
        }

        /* CTA */

        .cta-wrapper {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 32px 0 10px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .cta-text {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        /* Footer */

        .footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding: 25px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        .footer strong {
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        /* Mobile */

        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-wrapper {
                padding: 15px 8px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 25px 18px;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 28px 20px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }

            .order-meta td {
                display: block;
                width: 100%;
                text-align: left !important;
                padding: 12px 16px;
            }

            .course-details td {
                padding: 14px 12px;
            }

            .course-details td:nth-child(2) {
                width: 50px;
            }

            .course-details td:last-child {
                width: 90px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="email-wrapper">

        <div class="email-container">

            <!-- Header -->

            <div class="header">

                <div class="logo">
                    Elearning<span>.</span>
                </div>

                <div class="success-icon">
                    ✓
                </div>

                <h1>Order Confirmed!</h1>

                <p>Your learning journey starts now.</p>

            </div>


            <!-- Main Content -->

            <div class="content">

                <div class="greeting">
                    Thank you for choosing <strong>Elearning</strong>.
                    Your order has been successfully confirmed, and we're excited
                    to have you learning with us.
                </div>


                <!-- Order Information -->

                <h2 class="section-title">
                    Order Information
                </h2>

                <table class="order-meta">

                    <tr>

                        <td>
                            Order Number
                            <strong>
                                #<%= order._id %>
                            </strong>
                        </td>

                        <td>
                            Order Date
                            <strong>
                                <%= order.date %>
                            </strong>
                        </td>

                    </tr>

                </table>


                <!-- Course -->

                <h2 class="section-title">
                    What You Ordered
                </h2>

                <div class="course-card">

                    <div class="course-card-header">

                        <span class="course-label">
                            Course
                        </span>

                        <h3 class="course-name">
                            <%= order.name %>
                        </h3>

                    </div>

                    <table class="course-details">

                        <tr>

                            <td>
                                <%= order.name %>
                            </td>

                            <td>
                                1
                            </td>

                            <td>
                                $<%= order.price %>
                            </td>

                        </tr>

                    </table>

                </div>


                <!-- Payment Summary -->

                <h2 class="section-title">
                    Payment Summary
                </h2>

                <div class="summary">

                    <div class="summary-row">

                        <span class="summary-label">
                            Subtotal
                        </span>

                        <span class="summary-value">
                            $<%= order.price %>
                        </span>

                    </div>


                    <div class="summary-row">

                        <span class="summary-label">
                            Discount
                        </span>

                        <span class="summary-value">
                            $0.00
                        </span>

                    </div>


                    <div class="summary-row total-row">

                        <span class="summary-label">
                            Total Paid
                        </span>

                        <span class="summary-value">
                            $<%= order.price %>
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- CTA -->

                <div class="cta-wrapper">

                    <a href="#" class="cta-button">
                        Start Learning
                    </a>

                    <div class="cta-text">
                        Access your course from your Elearning dashboard.
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- Footer -->

            <div class="footer">

                <p>
                    Thank you for learning with <strong>Elearning</strong>.
                </p>

                <p>
                    If you have any questions about your order, please contact
                    our support team.
                </p>

                <p>
                    © 2026 Elearning. All rights reserved.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>

</html>
```
